            "parameters": {
                "color": 7,
                "width": 560,
                "height": 200,
                "content": "## AinSight WhatsApp Bot\n\nمستشار زراعي ذكي لجودة مياه الآبار — منطقة مراكش-آسفي\n\n**Flow:** WhatsApp message → Filter type → AI Agent (Darija) → Reply\n\nThe AI Agent has full domain knowledge about CE prediction, zones (Haouz/Chichaoua/Mejjate), and agricultural advice embedded in its system prompt."
            },
            "typeVersion": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "aa000001-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a2",
            "name": "Setup Instructions",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
            "position": [
                300,
                -520
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "color": 5,
                "width": 560,
                "height": 230,
                "content": "## Setup Steps\n\n1. Create a **Meta Business** account at business.facebook.com\n2. Create a **WhatsApp Business** app in developers.facebook.com\n3. Get your **Phone Number ID** and replace `YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID` in both reply nodes\n4. Add your **OpenAI API** credential (Settings → Credentials → Add → OpenAI)\n5. Add your **WhatsApp API** credentials (both trigger and send)\n6. Set the webhook URL in Meta → WhatsApp → Configuration\n7. **Activate** this workflow\n8. Send a message to your WhatsApp number — the bot will reply!"
            },
            "typeVersion": 1
        }
